            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.31</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Agents now counts every running agent

FIXED
"Agents now" counts every agent that worked in the last five minutes, so agents waiting on a build or on you still count.
An agent in one tool no longer drops out of the count while another tool is working.
]]></description>
