            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Bumps on every Mac

FIXED
A bump from a friend now appears on every Mac you're signed in on, not only on the one that checked first.
On a Mac set to the Buddhist calendar, agent usage now counts towards the right days.
]]></description>
