            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.29</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Agent time from Cowork and Orca

FIXED
Claude Code sessions run through Cowork in Claude Desktop now count towards your agent time.
Codex sessions started from Orca now count towards your agent time.
After this update Firstlight reads your agent history once more, so earlier Cowork and Orca sessions are counted too.
]]></description>
